      "screening_only": "Screening only",
      "second_act_desc": "5 sections: the new retirement reality, planning timeline by decade, financial bridge (Social Security, Medicare, LTC), encore careers (mission-driven second careers), phased retirement strategies. Many people don't retire fully at 65.",
      "secondary_issue_also_at_play": "Secondary issue also at play: ",
      "select_at_least_2_broad_abilities_firs": "Select at least 2 broad abilities first",
      "select_chc_broad_abilities_ai_critique": "Select CHC broad abilities → AI critiques what your mock battery would and would not capture.",
      "select_the_chc_broad_abilities_you_d_i": "Select the CHC broad abilities you'd include in a mock cognitive battery. Then ask the AI to critique what your battery would and wouldn't capture. This simulates the design decisions a psychoed evaluator makes.",
      "self_advocacy_desc": "5 sections: overview, K-12 advocacy skill-building, college Disability Services navigation, workplace ADA + accommodation requests, disclosure decision-making. The teachable skill that profoundly affects life trajectory.",
      "sem_sd_1_r_at_what_sd_does_r_95_force_": "SEM = SD × √(1−r). At what SD does r=.95 force SEM ≤ 3? At what SD does r=.70 force SEM ≥ 8? Why are the sliders here NOT independent in real instruments?",
      "sem_standard_error": "SEM (standard error)",
      "seminar_style_questions_that_surface_t": "Seminar-style questions that surface the tool's key tensions. Mix of technical, applied, ethical, and meta-level prompts. Good for weekly discussion sections, essay assignments, or in-class debate.",
      "skill_search_accessible_label": "Search skills",
      "skills_desc": "Cross-reference. Search any skill (e.g., \"patient assessment\", \"data analysis\") and see every career in the registry that uses it.",
