      "maillard_reactions_need_protein_amino_": ": Maillard reactions need protein (amino acids) + sugar + heat — that’s why bread crust, seared meat, and toasted marshmallows all develop similar brown, complex flavors. Caramelization only needs sugar + heat, and happens a bit hotter.",
      "maillard_vs_caramelization": "Maillard vs. caramelization",
