      "american_goldfinch_purple_finch_house_": "American Goldfinch, Purple Finch, House Finch, Pine Grosbeak, Common Redpoll, Pine Siskin, Evening Grosbeak, Red Crossbill, White-winged Crossbill. Year-round + irruptive winter visitors. Crossbills with unique crossed mandibles.",
