      "spider_webs_are_nearly_invisible_to_so": "Spider webs are nearly invisible to sonar",
      "stalactites_drip_water_watch_for_rippl": "Stalactites drip water — watch for ripples",
      "standard_moths_with_basic_flight_patte": "Standard moths with basic flight patterns. Some have evolved tympanic organs (ears) on their thorax that detect bat ultrasound, triggering evasive dives and loops.",
      "start_doppler_challenge_quiz": "Start Doppler challenge quiz",
      "stationary": "Stationary",
