      "if_this_is_post_exercise_or_after_illn": "If this is post-exercise or after illness, rehydrate with water + a salty snack or oral rehydration solution.",
      "if_you_are_struggling_with_mental_heal": "If you are struggling with mental health, please reach out to a doctor, therapist, school counselor, or trusted adult. Crisis support is available 24/7: ",
      "if_you_find_yourself_using_water_to_fe": "If you find yourself using water to feel \"full\" or override hunger, that is a body-cue mismatch worth talking about with a trusted adult. NEDA helpline: 1-800-931-2237.",
