      "who_would_have_to_keep_caring_about_it": "Who would have to keep caring about it for it to last?",
      "why_do_you_need_250_punches_to_make_a_": "Why do you need ~250 punches to make a single typeface, even though the alphabet has only 26 letters?",
      "why_is_naming_crassus_the_famously_wea": "Why is naming Crassus (the famously wealthy Roman) such a powerful rhetorical move in 1517?",
      "why_is_the_optimal_line_length_65_char": "Why is the optimal line length ~65 characters (Tschichold, Bringhurst)?",
