      "three_classroom_ready_worksheets_use_y": "Three classroom-ready worksheets. Use your browser's Print function (Ctrl/Cmd+P) on each card to get a printable page. Each is designed to fit one US Letter page.",
      "three_toed_sloth": "Three-toed Sloth",
      "time_of_arrival_difference": "time-of-arrival difference",
      "time_to_90_terminal": "Time to 90% terminal",
      "time_to_terminal": "Time to ~Terminal",
      "timeline": "⏰ Timeline",
