      "winter_tires_actually_matter": "Winter tires actually matter",
      "with_a_straight_back_your_wrist_should": "With a straight back, your wrist should rest on the TOP of the wheel when your arm is fully extended. That gives you 10-12 inches clearance to your chest — enough for the airbag to deploy without slamming into you.",
      "within_12_inches_of_curb_3_attempts_al": "Within 12 inches of curb. 3 attempts allowed. Mirrors + signals + head checks.",
